  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**叫做这个近似值的相对误差。**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果$x$是某量的准确值，$a$是它的近似值，那么这个近似",
        "值的相对误差等于$\\frac{|x-a|}{|a|}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例如，若把$0.2517$四舍五入到百分位时，得到了近似数",
        "$0.25$。求这样舍入的相对误差。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们有："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$x=0.2517$，$a=0.25$，",
        "$\\frac{|x-a|}{|a|}=\\frac{|0.2517-0.25|}{|0.25|}=\\frac{0.0017}{0.25}=0.0068$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "相对误差通常用百分数来表示。在这个例子中，舍入的",
        "相对误差等于$0.68\\%$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们回到本小节开始时所说的例子。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "书的厚度等于$6\\pm0.5$厘米。由于不知道度量的绝对误",
        "差，所以我们还不能算出相对误差。但是，我们知道，绝对误",
        "差不超过$0.5$厘米。因此，这次度量的相对误差不超过$\\frac{0.5\\mathrm{cm}}{6\\mathrm{cm}}↵",
        "=\\frac{1}{12}$。因为$\\frac{1}{12}=0.083\\cdots$，所以量得书的厚度的相对误差不",
        "超过$8.4\\%$。（相对误差只算上界，因此，无限小数$0.083$作",
        "四舍五入时取过剩近似值。）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "作类似地讨论，我们可求得度量书架长度的相对误差不",
        "超过$\\frac{0.5\\mathrm{cm}}{200\\mathrm{cm}}$，即$0.25\\%$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "通常说，量得书的厚度的相对准确度是$8.4\\%$，量得书架",
        "长度的相对准确度是$0.25\\%$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "162"
      ]
    }
  ]
